<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Provisional machine alignment proposed by Codex, Tibetan-first. Both source columns remain verbatim. The two visual-consciousness and river compounds retain strictly tighter members. The negation and causal relation recast as prevents/prevent him from are distributed and remain unbanked rather than falsely nulled. Lexical obstacle owns sgrib byed as a whole; its byed member is not assigned to a verb outside that noun. No hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
